# DDR 2ndMIX (System 573, analog board): a game played from power-on, to check
# HIRAKU's 573 core against MAME through gameplay. The first-boot flash install as
# in ddr2m-boot.his, then two coins (one credit), Start through the title, mode
# select (NORMAL), How To Play (skipped) and song select (BOYS), and the song
# played by stepping on all four panels every 8 frames: some arrows are hit,
# some missed. Hashes the main RAM every frame, snapshots every 60 frames.
game ddr2m

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

at 600 press "Service Mode" 8
at 10200 press "Service Mode" 8
at 11400 press "Coin 1" 8
at 11440 press "Coin 1" 8
at 11600 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 12200 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 12800 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 13400 press "1 Player Start" 8
from 13700 every 8 press "P1 Left" 4
from 13700 every 8 press "P1 Down" 4
from 13700 every 8 press "P1 Up" 4
from 13700 every 8 press "P1 Right" 4
from 0 every 60 snap
at 21000 quit
